[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
This nginx-devel (of azsupport/ports) has brotli, headers-more and geoip2
(for http) built in. The modules only some servers use are packages of
their own, which install their objects in %%PREFIX%%/libexec/nginx:

  nginx-devel-stream        stream (with realip, ssl, ssl_preread) and
                            geoip2 for stream
  nginx-devel-image-filter  image_filter

Load such a module in the main context of nginx.conf with load_module and
its full path; each package says its lines when it is installed.
EOM
}
]
